口。伯父簡之，有志榦，為高祖所知。高祖將謀興復，收集才力之士，嘗再造簡之，值有賓客。簡之悟其意，謂弟虔之曰：「劉下邳頻再來，必當有意。既不得共語，汝可試往見之。」既至，高祖已克京城，虔之即便投義。簡之聞之，殺耕牛，會聚徒眾，率以赴高祖。簡之歷官至通直常侍，少府，太尉諮議參軍。簡之弟謙之，好學，撰晉紀二十卷，義熙末，為始興相。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-050-liu-kangzu-kindred:p001:m0153","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-050-liu-kangzu-kindred:p001:m0016"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"簡之明稱弟，虔之與謙之分人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-050-liu-kangzu-kindred:p001:m0153","start":153,"end":155,"surface":"謙之","kind":"person","person_id":"7e3_6f5_aqx","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-liu-kangzu-kindred:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-liu-kangzu-kindred"},{"id":"c-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar:p001:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"謙之","kind":"person","person_id":"7e3_6f5_aqx","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar"},{"id":"c-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"謙之","kind":"person","person_id":"7e3_6f5_aqx","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar:p002","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-song050-qian2-jian","subject_person_id":"7e3_6f5_aqx","object_person_id":"dwr_is1_jaf","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"簡之弟謙之","relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"dwr_is1_jaf","younger_person_id":"7e3_6f5_aqx","operator":"lt","scope":"siblings","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-050","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-liu-kangzu-kindred","source_id":"s-songshu-050-liu-kangzu-kindred-ws2371899","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-liu-kangzu-kindred:p001","quote":"